<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= content_for(:title) || "1공장" %> — 1공장</title>
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@500;700&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css">
  <style>
    /* 공장 화면(styles.css)과 같은 토큰. 이 레이아웃에서만 쓰므로 여기에 둔다. */
    :root {
      --bg: #F1F5F9; --surface: #FFFFFF; --line: #E2E8F0;
      --ink: #0B1F3A; --muted: #475569; --accent: #1E3A8A; --error: #B91C1C;
      --r-1: 4px; --r-2: 8px; --r-3: 14px;
      --tile: 48px; /* 16px 타일 x3 */
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { word-break: keep-all; }
    body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100dvh;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Pretendard', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .auth { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(360px, 1fr); min-height: 100dvh; }
    .auth-intro { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 16px; padding: 48px 56px; }
    .auth-name { margin: 0; font-family: 'Outfit', 'Pretendard', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 700; }
    .auth-desc { margin: 0; max-width: 32ch; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
    .tiles { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .tile {
      display: block; width: var(--tile); height: var(--tile);
      background-color: var(--surface);
      background-image: url("/assets/kenney-tiny-factory/Tilemap/tilemap_packed.png");
      background-size: calc(var(--tile) * 12) calc(var(--tile) * 11);
      background-position: calc(var(--tile) * var(--tc) * -1) calc(var(--tile) * var(--tr) * -1);
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-1);
    }
    .auth-main { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 32px; }
    .card {
      width: 100%; max-width: 400px; padding: 32px;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-3);
    }
    .card h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
    .card .hint { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .field label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .field input {
      min-height: 44px; padding: 0 12px;
      font: inherit; color: var(--ink); background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-2);
    }
    .field input:focus-visible, .btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
    .btn {
      width: 100%; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 8px;
      font: inherit; font-weight: 600; color: #FFFFFF; cursor: pointer;
      background: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--r-2);
    }
    .error {
      margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--error); background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--error); border-radius: var(--r-2);
    }
    .error ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .auth { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .auth-intro { padding: 32px 24px 8px; }
      .auth-name { font-size: 32px; }
      .auth-main { padding: 16px 24px 32px; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="auth">
    <section class="auth-intro" aria-label="소개">
      <h1 class="auth-name">1공장</h1>
      <p class="auth-desc">기계 12대의 가동·정지·고장과 생산량을 한 화면에서 보고 조작하는 공장 관제 화면입니다.</p>
      <div class="tiles" aria-hidden="true">
        <i class="tile" style="--tc:3;--tr:6"></i>
        <i class="tile" style="--tc:3;--tr:7"></i>
        <i class="tile" style="--tc:3;--tr:8"></i>
        <i class="tile" style="--tc:3;--tr:9"></i>
      </div>
    </section>
    <main class="auth-main">
      <%= yield %>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
